Subject: [PATCH 02/18] r9q: Fix blob list and build for lineage-23.2

Drop blobs that AOSP/CAF now build for vendor (camera HIDL, gralloc
utils), keep the stock audio HAL under a renamed module, add the
camera/RIL blob dependencies missing from the list and dedupe entries
already in sm8350-common.
